        "original_id": "7092dd9c-74a7-5594-b2e3-2e23f71af8be",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Proof, DeShaun Dupree Holton, Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Kon Artis, Eminem, Diezel\n- Groups: D12, Goon Sqwad\n- Places: Detroit, Michigan\n- Products: The People vs.\n\nFacts:\n- DeShaun Dupree Holton, better known as Proof, was born on October 2, 1973.\n- Proof was an American rapper and actor from Detroit, Michigan.\n- Proof died on April 11, 2006.\n- The album The People vs. featured guest appearances by Obie Trice, Miz Korona, Jazze Pha, Proof, Kon Artis, Eminem, and Diezel.\n- Proof, Kon Artis, and Eminem were members of D12.\n- Diezel was Proof's brother and his bandmate in Goon Sqwad.",
